OL,3,GNEWSAAttempted murder arrest after
OL,4,Awoman stabbed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fattempted murder after a woman was left
OL,8,Fwith life-threatening injuries after
OL,9,Fbeing stabbed on Sunday morning.
OL,11,FThe 40-year-old woman was attacked on
OL,12,FReevy Crescent in Bradford at about
OL,13,F10:08 GMT and taken to Leeds General
OL,14,FInfirmary, West Yorkshire Police said.
OL,16,FThe 42-year-old man was arrested on
OL,17,Fsuspicion of attempted murder and also
OL,18,Fpossession of an offensive weapon.
OL,20,FPolice urged anyone with information to
OL,21,Fcontact officers as inquiries remained
OL,22,Fongoing.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
